  "correct": "3",
  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/ebadc30a979bf1a7e953d20901c3e7953c575296c0e0bb4af8a458ec3a64ab2c.png] \n\nGiven statement : 3 × 12 - 6 ÷ 2 + 12 = 16\n\nAccording to the question, after interchanging the signs :\n\nSo,\n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) : ÷ and +\n\n3 × 12 - 6 ÷ 2 + 12 = 16 ⇒ 3 × 12 - 6 + **2 ÷ 12**__ = 16\n\n__**3 × 12**__ - 6 + 0.16 = 16\n\n__**36 + 0.16**__ - 6 = 16\n\n__**36.16 - 6**__ = 16\n\n30.16 ≠ 16 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (2) : × and ÷ \n\n3 × 12 - 6 ÷ 2 + 12 = 16 ⇒ **3 ÷ 12**__ - 6 × 2 + 12 = 16\n\n0.25 - __**6 **____**×**____** 2**__ + 12 = 16\n\n__**0.25 +12**__ - 12 = 16\n\n__**12.25 - 12**__ = 16\n\n0.25 ≠ 16 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (3) : - and ÷\n\n3 × 12 - 6 ÷ 2 + 12 = 16 ⇒ 3 × **12 ÷ 6**__ - 2 + 12 = 16\n\n__**3 × **__**__2__** - 2 + 12 = 16\n\n__**6 **____**+ 12**__ - 2 = 16\n\n__**18 - 2**__ = 16\n\n16 = 16 (LHS = RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (4) : - and +\n\n3 × 12 - 6 ÷ 2 + 12 = 16 ⇒ 3 × 12 + **6 ÷ 2**__ - 12 = 16\n\n__**3 × 12**__ + 3 - 12 = 16\n\n__**36 **____**+ 3**__ - 12 = 16\n\n__**39 - 12**__ = 16\n\n27 ≠ 16 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option - (3)\" is the correct answer.",
